      <p>Neurodivergent Nest participates in affiliate programs, including the Amazon Associates Program and others. When you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, we earn a small commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
      <p>We only recommend products and services we genuinely believe will benefit our readers. Affiliate relationships never influence our editorial opinions or star ratings.</p>
      <p>If you have questions about a specific recommendation, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@neurodivergent-nest.vercel.app">hello@neurodivergent-nest.vercel.app</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
